nanocompile
An original Zig implementation of a local Rust and Zig compiler cache.

Architectural inspiration: kunobi-ninja/kache
https://github.com/kunobi-ninja/kache
Reference commit: 943dd2b0bbbf28958623eba689e7ad71bf8888e5
Adapted concepts: content-addressed artifact deduplication, copy-on-write
materialization, conservative compiler eligibility, and single-flight locking.
No Rust implementation source was copied.

